causes the hero's strength to increase by s[i] ( s[i] ≥ 1). In this case the hero enters dungeon
w[i] next ( w[i] > i).
Otherwise, the hero loses. This causes the hero's strength to increase by p[i] ( p[i] ≥ 1). In
this case the hero enters dungeon l[i] next.
